# drift voice-over — scripts/_vo/gen.py drift
# id | rate | pitch | text   (claims from seed-bnb-indo/drift/VERIFY-BNB.md: real BSC testnet deploy,
# cast smoke flow + engine writes, not verified on BscScan; the web capture had the Bybit link stubbed)
voice = en-GB-RyanNeural
hook     | +10% | +0Hz | Your bot reads the chart. It can't read the macro.
intro    | +8%  | -1Hz | DRIFT is a trading agent that knows the market regime.
bnb      | +10% | -1Hz | And its risk guard lives on BNB Chain.
regime   | +16% | -1Hz | It turns Bitcoin's volatility and trend into a regime, on-chain.
veto     | +16% | -1Hz | Risk-off blocks longs. Too deep a loss halts the bot.
cockpit  | +12% | -1Hz | The real web cockpit: live markets and out-of-sample research.
stub     | +16% | -1Hz | The guard is live. The Bybit link is stubbed here.
live     | +12% | -1Hz | On testnet, risk-off vetoes the long.
limit    | +14% | -1Hz | Past the twenty percent limit, the bot halts.
agent    | +14% | -1Hz | Only the agent can steer it.
forced   | +12% | +0Hz | Someone forced risk-on.
engine   | +12% | -1Hz | The engine put it back, on its own.
txs      | +12% | -1Hz | Eight live transactions, every receipt status one.
gas      | +25% | -1Hz | Seven of seven tests, and gas under a ten-thousandth of a test BNB.
outro    | -2%  | -2Hz | The guard has the last word.
